{% comment %}
  Prints the price a wholesaler pays for a variant, in cents, excluding GST.
  @param {object} variant
  - Wholesalers pay full price (RRP); only the bulk order discounts (5% over $1,000, 10% over
    $5,000, set up in Shopify Discounts) come off. So by default this is the RRP without GST.
  - Theme settings > APEX Feeds > Wholesale "Wholesale discount off RRP" takes a % off first
    (0 = none), and a variant metafield custom.wholesale_price (Decimal, ex GST) overrides both.
    Only use those if checkout charges the same.
  Use: {%- capture wp -%}{%- render 'apex-wholesale-price', variant: variant -%}{%- endcapture -%}
{% endcomment %}
{%- liquid
  assign wp = variant.metafields.custom.wholesale_price.value
  if wp != blank
    assign cents = wp | times: 100 | round
    echo cents
  else
    assign pct = settings.apex_wholesale_fallback_discount | default: 0
    assign keep = 100 | minus: pct
    if settings.apex_wholesale_prices_include_gst
      assign cents = variant.price | times: keep | divided_by: 110.0 | round
    else
      assign cents = variant.price | times: keep | divided_by: 100.0 | round
    endif
    echo cents
  endif
-%}
